---
// Benefícios — 4 cards
---
<section class="py-20 lg:py-32 px-6 bg-surface/30">
  <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto">
    <div class="text-center mb-14">
      <p class="text-neon text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest mb-4">Feito pra bancada</p>
      <h2 class="font-black tracking-tight text-ice" style="font-size: clamp(1.75rem, 4vw, 3rem);">
        Por que o AssisTech?
      </h2>
    </div>

    <div class="grid sm:grid-cols-2 gap-5">

      <div class="bg-card border border-white/5 rounded-2xl p-8 hover:border-neon/20 transition-colors">
        <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mb-6"
             style="background: rgba(124,255,0,0.08); border: 1px solid rgba(124,255,0,0.15);">
          <img src="/icone-compatibilidade.png" alt="" width="20" height="20" class="w-5 h-5" />
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-xl font-black text-ice mb-3">Resposta em segundos</h3>
        <p class="leading-relaxed text-muted">
          Chega de buscar em lista ou arriscar na frente do cliente. Tolera até digitação errada.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-card border border-white/5 rounded-2xl p-8 hover:border-neon/20 transition-colors">
        <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mb-6"
             style="background: rgba(124,255,0,0.08); border: 1px solid rgba(124,255,0,0.15);">
          <img src="/icone-compatibilidade.png" alt="" width="20" height="20" class="w-5 h-5" />
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-xl font-black text-ice mb-3">Não perde venda</h3>
        <p class="leading-relaxed text-muted">
          Se não tem o modelo exato, mostra o compatível. Cliente não sai de mãos vazias.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-card border border-white/5 rounded-2xl p-8 hover:border-neon/20 transition-colors">
        <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mb-6"
             style="background: rgba(124,255,0,0.08); border: 1px solid rgba(124,255,0,0.15);">
          <img src="/icone-os.png" alt="" class="w-5 h-5" />
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-xl font-black text-ice mb-3">OS com a sua marca</h3>
        <p class="leading-relaxed text-muted">
          Documento que passa confiança e organiza a garantia. PDF com o nome da sua loja, pronto pra assinar.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-card border border-white/5 rounded-2xl p-8 hover:border-neon/20 transition-colors">
        <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mb-6"
             style="background: rgba(124,255,0,0.08); border: 1px solid rgba(124,255,0,0.15);">
          <img src="/icone-whatsapp.png" alt="" class="w-5 h-5" />
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-xl font-black text-ice mb-3">Tudo no WhatsApp</h3>
        <p class="leading-relaxed text-muted">
          Sem instalar app, sem aprender painel. Na conversa que você já usa o dia todo.
        </p>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>
